{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:24 2026-06-26 HKT</p>\n\n<p>New Balance開倉2折起！New Balance作為國際知名運動品牌，以優質工藝和舒適性能深受消費者喜愛，品牌於6月26日起與OnTheList合作，舉行開倉優惠，全場劈至2折發售，最平$291起即可入手多款鞋履，包括經典鞋款991、993、潮流款式 2000、2010，連韓國人氣女歌手李知恩IU同款471系列都有，現場更有折上折優惠，記得把握優惠價入手。</p>\n<h2>New Balance開倉2折起！一連8日$425起入手經典鞋款</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcb75188816f4b1c691b6797ed0b2276/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d6bf9ea766ef7e6b7f21f0f9927928f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_14_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6240eb9921c6cd3157f77e72dcada3f5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79df679db9522b3d1205714e815ec30e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_15_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b144345b03eb094d6a80f24cc2ba0026/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_15_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a59be9c4a30332b9f6a9e78e586a644f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_15_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3591a83e9da348c9e0b79a7b3e042468/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44b1b9dbe1ee39f2b9114cccbfc826cf/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_16_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f75e606d1893b3d2c566b1a8ccd5718/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_16_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cfc08a0835c915e477ed35f70632853/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_16_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f75b994c45d4e7a7bef6e5170d4985db/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-26_at_10_44_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00352325209ca9bb6ca0e4a1de